{"html": "<div class=\"card\">\n  <h2>🧮 Calculateurs interactifs</h2>\n  <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem\">Les résultats se mettent à jour automatiquement.</p>\n\n  <h3>1. Audio — Débit & taille</h3>\n  <div class=\"calc\">\n    <div><label>Fe (Hz)</label><input id=\"aFe\" type=\"number\" value=\"44100\" oninput=\"calcAudio()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Bits (B)</label><input id=\"aB\" type=\"number\" value=\"16\" oninput=\"calcAudio()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Canaux</label><input id=\"aCh\" type=\"number\" value=\"2\" oninput=\"calcAudio()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Durée (s)</label><input id=\"aT\" type=\"number\" value=\"60\" oninput=\"calcAudio()\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"result\" id=\"rAudio\"></div>\n\n  <h3>2. Audio — SNR & Nyquist</h3>\n  <div class=\"calc\">\n    <div><label>Bits (B)</label><input id=\"sB\" type=\"number\" value=\"16\" oninput=\"calcSNR()\"></div>\n    <div><label>fmax (Hz)</label><input id=\"nyF\" type=\"number\" value=\"20000\" oninput=\"calcNyq()\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"result\" id=\"rSNR\"></div>\n  <div class=\"result\" id=\"rNyq\"></div>\n\n  <h3>3. Audio — Quantification</h3>\n  <div class=\"calc\">\n    <div><label>Bits (B)</label><input id=\"qB\" type=\"number\" value=\"8\" oninput=\"calcQuant()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Vmax</label><input id=\"qMax\" type=\"number\" value=\"1\" oninput=\"calcQuant()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Vmin</label><input id=\"qMin\" type=\"number\" value=\"-1\" oninput=\"calcQuant()\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"result\" id=\"rQuant\"></div>\n\n  <h3>4. Vidéo — Débit brut</h3>\n  <div class=\"calc\">\n    <div><label>Largeur</label><input id=\"vW\" type=\"number\" value=\"1920\" oninput=\"calcVideo()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Hauteur</label><input id=\"vH\" type=\"number\" value=\"1080\" oninput=\"calcVideo()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Bits/pixel</label><input id=\"vBpp\" type=\"number\" value=\"24\" oninput=\"calcVideo()\"></div>\n    <div><label>fps</label><input id=\"vFps\" type=\"number\" value=\"30\" oninput=\"calcVideo()\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"result\" id=\"rVideo\"></div>\n\n  <h3>5. Image — Taille brute</h3>\n  <div class=\"calc\">\n    <div><label>Largeur</label><input id=\"iW\" type=\"number\" value=\"1920\" oninput=\"calcImg()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Hauteur</label><input id=\"iH\" type=\"number\" value=\"1080\" oninput=\"calcImg()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Mode</label><select id=\"iMode\" onchange=\"calcImg()\"><option value=\"1\">B/N (1 bit)</option><option value=\"8\">Gris (8 bits)</option><option value=\"24\" selected>RGB (24 bits)</option><option value=\"32\">RGBA (32 bits)</option></select></div>\n    <div><label>Compression JPEG (%)</label><input id=\"iComp\" type=\"number\" value=\"10\" oninput=\"calcImg()\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"result\" id=\"rImg\"></div>\n\n  <h3>6. MPEG — Taille compressée (GOP)</h3>\n  <div class=\"calc\">\n    <div><label>Taille originale (Mo)</label><input id=\"mS\" type=\"number\" value=\"60\" oninput=\"calcMPEG()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Poids I (%)</label><input id=\"mI\" type=\"number\" value=\"100\" oninput=\"calcMPEG()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Poids P (%)</label><input id=\"mP\" type=\"number\" value=\"50\" oninput=\"calcMPEG()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Poids B (%)</label><input id=\"mB\" type=\"number\" value=\"20\" oninput=\"calcMPEG()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Nb I</label><input id=\"nI\" type=\"number\" value=\"2\" oninput=\"calcMPEG()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Nb P</label><input id=\"nP\" type=\"number\" value=\"2\" oninput=\"calcMPEG()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Nb B</label><input id=\"nB\" type=\"number\" value=\"6\" oninput=\"calcMPEG()\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"result\" id=\"rMPEG\"></div>\n\n  <h3>7. Latence bout-en-bout</h3>\n  <div class=\"calc\">\n    <div><label>Capture (ms)</label><input id=\"l1\" type=\"number\" value=\"20\" oninput=\"calcLat()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Encodage (ms)</label><input id=\"l2\" type=\"number\" value=\"30\" oninput=\"calcLat()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Réseau (ms)</label><input id=\"l3\" type=\"number\" value=\"40\" oninput=\"calcLat()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Jitter (ms)</label><input id=\"l4\" type=\"number\" value=\"60\" oninput=\"calcLat()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Décodage (ms)</label><input id=\"l5\" type=\"number\" value=\"20\" oninput=\"calcLat()\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"result\" id=\"rLat\"></div>\n\n  <h3>8. VoIP — Bande passante</h3>\n  <div class=\"calc\">\n    <div><label>Nb appels</label><input id=\"voN\" type=\"number\" value=\"50\" oninput=\"calcVoIP()\"></div>\n    <div><label>Débit/appel (kbit/s)</label><input id=\"voD\" type=\"number\" value=\"87.2\" oninput=\"calcVoIP()\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"result\" id=\"rVoIP\"></div>\n</div>"}